      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Callback envoked after weights have been edited.\nCalls \\c PushWeightsToMesh() on each \\c ClothLodData, and invalidates cached data.\nOptionaly recalculate the owner's sections fixed vertex data based on this asset masks, and invalidate the DDC for this asset."
